<header><p class="st-kicker">tribal confederation · Iberia</p><h1 class="st-title">Airenosi</h1><p class="st-meta">300 BCE – 195 BCE (approx.)</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">A Pyrenean people known only from Polybius' list of those Hannibal conquered in 218 BCE, possibly of the Val d'Aran.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The Airenosi appear in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/polybius">Polybius</a> among the peoples between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ebro-river">Ebro</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pyrenees">Pyrenees</a> subdued by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hannibal">Hannibal</a> in 218 BCE. Their location is uncertain; they are often placed in the central Pyrenees, perhaps in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/val-daran">Val d'Aran</a>, on the basis of their name.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>Nothing is known of their society or government.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>After <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hannibal">Hannibal's</a> conquest the region was held for <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/carthage">Carthage</a> by Hanno until the Roman advance. It came under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> in the early 2nd century BCE, and the Airenosi disappear from the record.</p><p class="st-conf">Few sources survive for this state; details are uncertain.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="tribal confederation, 300 BCE – 195 BCE (approx.)"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="44" cy="56" rx="16" ry="24"/><path d="M44 34 V78"/><path d="M68 20 V84"/><path d="M68 20 L63 30 H73 Z"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">tribal confederation</p><p class="st-emblem-region">Iberia</p><div class="st-span" aria-hidden="true"><span class="st-span-bar" style="left:53.73%;width:2.09%"></span></div><div class="st-span-axis" aria-hidden="true"><span>3000 BCE</span><span>1 CE</span><span>2000</span></div></div><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>300 BCE – 195 BCE (approx.)</dd><dt>Centuries</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/4th-century-bce">4th century BCE</a> – <a href="/centuries/2nd-century-bce">2nd century BCE</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>tribal confederation</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>tribal</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/spain">Spain</a></dd><dt>Also</dt><dd>Arenosii</dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=-248&amp;focus=airenosi" aria-label="Airenosi on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4595 744 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Airenosi lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M4975 1081h0M5031 967h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M4915 1000h0"/><path class="map-dot-ap" d="M4915 1000h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>Location approximate: shown in present-day Spain. <a href="/atlas?year=-248&amp;focus=airenosi">On the atlas &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></aside></div>
